// A new instance of a `Var` type falsifies every other instance; of a `Function` type, every instance with the same first component.
Var v Identified by 1..3
Fact d Identified by A, B
Fact c Identified by 1..2
Function f Identified by d * c.
+v(1). +v(2).
?v(2). ?!v(1).
+f(A, 1). +f(B, 1). +f(A, 2).
?f(A, 2). ?!f(A, 1). ?f(B, 1).
